⍝ ‹report›: say how a send went
⦃ ⁇ ⦃ ⌁ $sent\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ $not sent: $ ⎙̵ ‹serror› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨◌ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹report› ⸫

